Cyber police wanted to investigate a case; they wanted to check a list of phone numbers that had 945 anywhere in the phone number. A method was created to convert the phone number in long data type to a string and check for the existence of the number 945. Fill in the blanks (a) and (b):
void check(long pno) {
  String s = _____(a)_____;
  if( _____(b)_____)
    System.out.println(pno);
}

A manager wants to check the number of employees with names ending with KUMAR. Fill in the blanks in the given program segment:
void count(String s[]) {
  int i, l = _________, c = 0;
  for(i=0; i<l; i++) {
    if( ________________)
      c++;
  }
  System.out.println(c);
}

Give the output of the following program segment when a=6, b=4:
for(k=a; k<=a*b; k+=a) {
  if(k % b == 0)
    break;
}
System.out.println(k);

Kamal wants to display only the alphabets stored in a character array. While compiling the code, an error was displayed. Check for the statement with the error and write the correct statement:
int i;
for(i=0; i<arr.length; i++) {
  if(Character.isLetter(arr))
    System.out.println(arr);
}

modelAnswer:
Statements with error:
  if(Character.isLetter(arr))
  System.out.println(arr)

Corrected statements:
  if(Character.isLetter(arr[i]))
  System.out.println(arr[i])

