Convert the following for loop segment to an exit-controlled loop:
for(k=10; k>=-1; k--)
  System.out.println(k*2);
System.out.println(k*4);

modelAnswer:
k=10;
do {
  System.out.println(k*2);
  k--;
} while(k >= -1);
System.out.println(k*4);

